# L §2.2 (writer 8): meta is gone from the built-ins, with its fields; a call takes a built-in's name or a band's id
# (L §2.3 Calls), so meta(...) names no band: LOAD-NAME.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source tab "tab"
input x: int

version v1
  cite tab
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  x = 1 "s"

ask q1: meta(x, 2026-06-30).version, meta(x, 2026-06-30).source
ask q2: meta(x, 2026-06-30).governs.from
ask q3: meta(x, 2026-06-30).version == "v1" law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME ...
